  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sv Kristna R&#xe5;d OPT CAP 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sw Council of Churches OPT CAP 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r att minska &#xf6;vergrepen mot de m&#xe4;nskliga       r&#xe4;ttigheterna och internationell humanit&#xe4;r lag i Palestina och        Israel. Detta genom ett ekumeniskt f&#xf6;ljeslagare program d&#xe4;r personer  fr&#xe5;n hela v&#xe4;rlden kommer f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja civilt fredsskapande genom    icke-v&#xe5;lds metoder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the Ecumenical Accompaniment Programme in Palestine and       Israel (EAPPI), people from different parts of the world come as      ecumenical accompaniers to Palestine and Israel, to support, with     non-violent means, through civilian peacekeeping. The overall         objective of the programme is to decrease violations of human rights  and international humanitarian law (IHL) in Palestine and Israel.</narrative>
  </description>
